/* ===========================================================================
 *  Localizable.strings — العربية (Arabic)
 *  StudyForge
 *
 *  Keys MUST match en.lproj/Localizable.strings exactly. A missing key silently
 *  falls back to the key itself, which is how a half-translated app ships.
 *
 *  ⚠️  TRANSLATION STATUS: these were produced without a native speaker. They
 *  are grammatically standard UI Arabic, but a native reviewer must sign them
 *  off before the VIVA — particularly the legal lines (terms/privacy) and the
 *  privacy claim in auth.signUp.subtitle, which is a factual promise about where
 *  data goes and must not be mistranslated.
 *
 *  RTL: set the scheme's language to Arabic to test mirroring. Layouts must be
 *  checked at AX5 in Arabic — mirrored + large type is the combination that
 *  breaks.
 * =========================================================================== */

